{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [

    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "crossComponentResources": [
          "/subscriptions/d201ebeb-c470-4a6f-82d5-c2f95bb0dc1e/resourceGroups/rg-contoso-ai-platform-dev/providers/Microsoft.OperationalInsights/workspaces/law-contoso-ai-dev"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "tr-param",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "label": "Time Range",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "value": { "durationMs": 3600000 },
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                { "durationMs": 300000 },
                { "durationMs": 900000 },
                { "durationMs": 1800000 },
                { "durationMs": 3600000 },
                { "durationMs": 14400000 },
                { "durationMs": 86400000 }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "corrId-param",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "CorrelationId",
            "label": "Correlation ID (optional drilldown)",
            "type": 1,
            "isRequired": false,
            "value": "",
            "typeSettings": { "createOnLoad": false }
          }
        ],
        "style": "above",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "params"
    },

    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# AppGW \u2192 APIM \u2192 Azure AI Foundry \u2014 End-to-End Trace\n\nDistributed trace waterfall stitched across three layers via **X-Correlation-Id**:\n\n| Layer | Data Source | Metric |\n|---|---|---|\n| **App Gateway WAF** | `AGWAccessLogs` (Log Analytics) | Total connection time from client |\n| **APIM Gateway** | `AppRequests` (App Insights) | APIM processing + backend call |\n| **Azure AI Foundry** | `AppDependencies` (App Insights) | Foundry model inference time |\n\n**How correlation works:** The App Gateway rewrite rule stamps `X-Correlation-Id: {var_client_ip}-{var_client_port}` on every forwarded request (Azure App Gateway does not expose a per-request UUID; the TCP source port is unique per active connection, so this pair is unique within any live request window). APIM captures it as `customDimensions[\"Request-Header-X-Correlation-Id\"]` in App Insights and forwards it to Foundry. The APIM \u2192 Foundry join uses the header value directly. The AppGW row is matched approximately using the client IP from the corrId and the APIM request time binned to 2 seconds.\n\n> Use the **Correlation ID** parameter above to drill into a single request trace."
      },
      "name": "header"
    },

    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## Summary" },
      "name": "section-summary"
    },

    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "// Summary tiles: total volume and avg per-layer latency\nlet apimRequests = AppRequests\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| extend corrId = tostring(customDimensions[\"Request-Header-X-Correlation-Id\"])\n| where isnotempty(corrId);\nlet foundryDeps = AppDependencies\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where Type == \"HTTP\"\n| extend corrId = tostring(customDimensions[\"Request-Header-X-Correlation-Id\"])\n| where isnotempty(corrId);\nunion\n  (apimRequests\n   | summarize\n       Value = count(),\n       Sub   = strcat(\"avg \", round(avg(DurationMs), 0), \" ms\")\n   | extend Metric = \"Total Requests\"),\n  (apimRequests\n   | summarize\n       Value = round(avg(DurationMs), 0),\n       Sub   = \"milliseconds\"\n   | extend Metric = \"Avg APIM Latency\"),\n  (foundryDeps\n   | summarize\n       Value = round(avg(DurationMs), 0),\n       Sub   = \"milliseconds\"\n   | extend Metric = \"Avg Foundry Latency\"),\n  (apimRequests\n   | where Success == false\n   | summarize\n       Value = count(),\n       Sub   = \"errors\"\n   | extend Metric = \"Failed Requests\")\n| project Metric, Value, Sub",
        "size": 4,
        "title": "Traffic overview (APIM-correlated requests only)",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "crossComponentResources": [
