    },

    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": { "json": "## App Insights Transaction Search Link\n\nFor a **single-request drill-down** (every span on one timeline similar to Jaeger), set the **Correlation ID** parameter above, then copy the `opId` value from the trace table and paste it into [App Insights → Transaction Search](https://portal.azure.com) (`operation_Id = <opId>`). This shows the W3C-correlated APIM frontend span, APIM→Foundry dependency span, and any OpenTelemetry spans your client code emits — all linked by the same `operation_Id`." },
